{"page": 4, "kind": "cell", "table": 1, "row": 9, "col": 4, "x": null, "text": "• Response to Explorers and Whalers: aggression, excitement, fear • Response to Settlers, Traders, and Missionaries: collaboration and cooperation, conflict, negotiation, resistance", "id": "u82", "furniture": false}
