{"page": 4, "kind": "cell", "table": 1, "row": 19, "col": 4, "x": null, "text": "• Global Economic Participation: fishing for export, mining, providing farm labor, selling copra to colonizing powers, serving in the military", "id": "u96", "furniture": false}
