{"page": 4, "kind": "cell", "table": 1, "row": 23, "col": 3, "x": null, "text": "Content Standard SS.7PI.2.7.4 Analyze the interests and obligations of colonial powers in Pacific Island nations and entities since World War II", "id": "u101", "furniture": false}
