{"page": 5, "kind": "cell", "table": 1, "row": 9, "col": 3, "x": null, "text": "Content Standard SS.7PI.3.14.1 Explain the social, environmental, and economic impacts of nuclear testing and militarization on Pacific Islander peoples and island environments", "id": "u119", "furniture": false}
{"page": 5, "kind": "cell", "table": 1, "row": 9, "col": 4, "x": null, "text": "• Social Nuclear Testing Impacts: loss of culture, ongoing health concerns, relocation of entire populations • Environmental Nuclear Testing Impacts: contaminated animals, food, plants, and water; physical damage to reefs • Economic Nuclear Testing Impacts: denial of use of prime land and harbor areas, inability to harvest fish • Militarization: land annexation, military bases, missile defense sites", "id": "u120", "furniture": false}
